# Python development rules

Support Python 3.9–3.12. Keep the frontal_sdk import package distinct from the frontal distribution. Follow existing uv/Hatchling, HTTPX, Pydantic v2, Ruff, mypy, pytest, anyio, and RESPX patterns. Keep service behavior grounded in the committed contracts.

When implementing behavior changes, add deterministic offline coverage using the repository's existing test tools. Update docs and runnable examples for public API changes. See `AGENTS.md` for project-specific rules and use the applicable skill under `skills/`.
